    {
      "id": "M4149-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "A: 虚构特征模块：v=[2,-3]，逐元素门值g=[0.2,0.8]由sigmoid产生，最终y=v+g⊙v。作者写“由于门值位于0和1之间，输出必然抑制所有原特征、删除低权重变量，g就是变量发生故障的概率；把g置1就等于只保留原特征的无门控对照”。请计算y，核对分支门控与最终残差输出、变量删除/概率含义及g=0/1的不同控制。给不超过40词的正向英文方法句，保留真实操作，不把所有否定核查塞进正文，也不把门控说成只能有一种归一化或每个门都必须硬选择。另有原文把这种权重称attention，不要只凭这个词就擅自改其运算或否定全部门控含义。\n",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Preserve the specified sigmoid-regulated branch and residual addition, with the correct toy output and gate-zero/one controls.",
        "Separate branch attenuation, final output, variable removal and probability meaning; preserve valid attention/gating overlap."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Infer unconditional suppression, deleted variables, physical fault probabilities or a universal neutral gate value.",
        "Rename or reject an attributed attention operation solely from its label."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserves the sigmoid-regulated branch, residual output and different gate-zero/one controls without inventing variable deletion, fault probabilities or a universal gate taxonomy.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4149-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4149-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_two_unchanged_requests_on_final_snapshot"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4149-B",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "B: 虚构工业分类模型：局部编码器产生变量历史特征x；关系编码器产生邻域特征h。所有x/h均先完整计算，g=sigmoid(MLP(concat(x,h)))逐元素调节h，r=x+g⊙h后供分类器使用。训练后MLP参数固定，门值随输入变化。当前作者已批准将这个新组合命名为Context-Gated Fusion，但没有批准中文完整名；它不是专家稀疏调度、工况概率、持续参数学习或新的采样控制。两个给定案例中，与其余模型/训练设置一致的固定门g=0.5对照相比，分类准确率更高；无延迟/省算/跨厂或在线部署证据。请写105-125词英文摘要和不超过40词的一项贡献候选，连清互补特征、真实门控输入、被调节对象、残差结合与分类比较。保留作者提出名字并定义其计算，不纳入通用库、不因缺少前人同名拒绝合法的新名字；也不要从单篇论文的完整名称借出一个通用Age-Aware State Gate或“年龄门控”。中文基础词可以用门控机制，但完整限定名未核实就不宣称是标准译法。把必要作者核查放在说明中，不用防御性尾句充满摘要。题设字数只是本题约束。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Preserve the approved hypothetical name, gate inputs, regulated neighborhood contribution and residual classifier path.",
        "Retain input-dependent weights with fixed trained parameters and the matched fixed-gate two-case comparison."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Promote a full fictional name or unsupported time/age-qualified name to a generic category or standard Chinese translation.",
        "Invent online parameter learning, sparse dispatch, sampling control, calibrated fault probabilities, latency savings or deployment."
      ],
